  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.0.11\n- Canonical record writes use durable same-directory staging and atomic publication under cross-process locks.\n- Story planning validates the complete task set before publishing and doctor detects incomplete story/task sets.\n- Agent setup supports all, codex, and claude targets while keeping all-host compatibility as the default.\n- Release identity, clean-checkout formatting, package smoke tests, and npm dependency automation are enforced in CI.\n- The reviewer portal is started with `serve`, labels its local trust boundary, repeats decision context, batches task data, permits comment-free acceptance, requires rejection reasons, and adds component-level tests.",
